[21.487315, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.487476, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 6. Same fetch through AgentGuard: URL is allowed, output is blocked as injection ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[22.897141, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"jsonrpc\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"result\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"protocolVersion\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2024-11-05\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"serverInfo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"agentguard-demo-vulnerable-server\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"version\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"0.1.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"capabilities\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"tools\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"resources\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"prompts\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.950055, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"jsonrpc\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m2\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"result\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"content\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m[\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"AgentGuard: this tool output was blocked — suspected prompt injection (matched rules: exfiltrate_secret, ignore_instructions, role_override).\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"isError\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39mtrue\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.452305, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.452479, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 7. A clean page still fetches normally ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[25.868456, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"jsonrpc\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"result\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"protocolVersion\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2024-11-05\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"serverInfo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"agentguard-demo-vulnerable-server\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"version\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"0.1.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"capabilities\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"tools\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"resources\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"prompts\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.920481, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"jsonrpc\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2.0\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m2\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"result\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"content\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m[\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"Project README\\n\\nThis library has no dependencies and a permissive license. See CONTRIBUTING.md for how to submit a patch.\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.422833, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.423162, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 7b. What did all of that touch? agentguard report, from the audit log alone ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[28.624686, "o", "\u001b[2mOne session per proxy run above; a real agent session is one block.\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[29.226521, "o", "\u001b[2mSix sessions in this log. The two that did more than allow or deny:\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[30.041101, "o", "audit log: /tmp/tmp.v8vjJfk1Qx/agentguard_audit.log\r\nchain: OK, 20 entries verified\r\n\r\n== session c630c2dd2bb6  2026-09-24 14:19:37 -> 14:19:37 (0.039s), exit 0\r\n   server: python3 demo/vulnerable_server.py\r\n   policy: agentguard/policies/default.yaml (sha256 7f8e52b08680ab2c...)\r\n   calls: 1 allowed, 0 denied\r\n   files touched: 1\r\n     /tmp/tmp.v8vjJfk1Qx/\r\n       deploy_notes.txt                     read_file\r\n   hosts contacted: none\r\n   commands run: none\r\n   blocked calls: none\r\n   redactions: 1\r\n     14:19:37  read_file            aws_access_key_id\r\n   injection blocks: none\r\n   budgets: allowed calls by category: file_access 1\r\n   timeline:\r\n     14:19:37  session_start       python3 demo/vulnerable_server.py\r\n     14:19:37  policy_decision     ALLOW  read_file {\"path\": \"/tmp/tmp.v8vjJfk1Qx/deploy_notes.txt\"}"]
[30.04144, "o", "\r\n     14:19:37  redaction           read_file: aws_access_key_id\r\n     14:19:37  session_end         exit 0\r\n"]
[31.662494, "o", "== session 7a9d85af092f  2026-09-24 14:19:43 -> 14:19:43 (0.039s), exit 0\r\n   server: python3 demo/vulnerable_server.py\r\n   policy: agentguard/policies/default.yaml (sha256 7f8e52b08680ab2c...)\r\n   calls: 1 allowed, 0 denied\r\n   files touched: none\r\n   hosts contacted: 1\r\n       blog.example.com                     fetch_url\r\n   commands run: none\r\n   blocked calls: none\r\n   redactions: none\r\n   injection blocks: 1\r\n     14:19:43  fetch_url            exfiltrate_secret, ignore_instructions, role_override\r\n   budgets: allowed calls by category: network 1\r\n   timeline:\r\n     14:19:43  session_start       python3 demo/vulnerable_server.py\r\n     14:19:43  policy_decision     ALLOW  fetch_url {\"url\": \"https://blog.example.com/cookie-recipe\"}\r\n     14:19:43  injection_blocked   fetch_url: exfiltrate_secret, ignore_instructions, role_override\r\n     14:19:43  session_end         exit 0\r\n"]
[33.676482, "o", "\r\n"]
[33.676755, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 8. Verify the audit log's hash chain ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[34.978433, "o", "OK: 20 entries verified, hash chain intact.\r\nnote: without an anchor, entries removed from the end, or a log rewritten from scratch, can't be detected. See `agentguard anchor`.\r\n"]
[36.4925, "o", "\r\n"]
[36.492568, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 9. Someone edits a past entry directly in the file (covering their tracks) ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[37.721311, "o", "before: allowed=False\r\n"]
[37.721495, "o", "after:  allowed=True  (edited directly in the file)\r\n"]
[39.228556, "o", "\r\n"]
[39.228751, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m== 10. Verify again: the edit is caught immediately ==\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
[40.751932, "o", "TAMPERED: line 2: hash does not match entry contents — entry was modified (verified 1 entries before the break)\r\n"]
[41.792945, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32mDone.\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mgithub.com/zgemini22/AgentGuard — see README.md and THREAT_MODEL.md for the full picture.\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
